136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 96 0 R
/T (We are building an automatic checker for Indonesian news and claims. It takes a claim or article, from one sentence to several paragraphs, formal or informal, and returns a credibility indication, with the official refutation attached when one exists. It works as a pipeline of three NLP tasks in which the output of each becomes the input of the next. It is a first-pass aid that speeds up screening, not the final judge: verdicts with low confidence go to a person, and a claim with no match in the reference base is reported more cautiously.)
/E (We are building an automatic checker for Indonesian news and claims. It takes a claim or article, from one sentence to several paragraphs, formal or informal, and returns a credibility indication, with the official refutation attached when one exists. It works as a pipeline of three NLP tasks in which the output of each becomes the input of the next. It is a first-pass aid that speeds up screening, not the final judge: verdicts with low confidence go to a person, and a claim with no match in the reference base is reported more cautiously.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
